unavailable_task_builder_bitmap.description:
Fixed-length canonical bitmap over the locked Task Builders, not a digest;
REST uses Base64.

REST input accepts the standard or URL-safe Base64 alphabet, padded or unpadded; REST output is always the canonical padded standard-alphabet form.

task.v1.QuerySessionTerminalSummaryRespo.description:
QuerySessionTerminalSummaryResponse returns the single terminal summary;
NotFound after its retention expires (§16.2).
QuerySessionTerminalSummaryResponse defines the QuerySessionTerminalSummaryResponse wire type.

task.v1.WorkerEvidenceReceiptState.description:
WorkerEvidenceReceiptState is the compact auditable receipt retained on chain;
raw signatures and MMR proof nodes are never persisted here.
WorkerEvidenceReceiptState defines the WorkerEvidenceReceiptState wire type.
